ng animals  to move from their home we're seeing  habitat destruction at the UN climate  summit in Madrid next week negotiators  from around the world will be under  pressure to cut emissions faster this  report warns delaying action by just one  year will make it even harder and more  expensive to stabilize the planet's  climate Thomas More Sky News
 

